  "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"508\">Duik in een verwoest Washington D.C. in <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"330\">Tom Clancy’s The Division 2</strong> voor <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"353\">PlayStation 4</strong>. In deze intense online shooter neem je het op tegen vijandige facties, bouw je je personage uit en werk je samen met andere spelers om de stad te redden.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"666\">De game is <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"539\">in goede staat</strong>, <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"571\">volledig getest op werking</strong> en geschikt voor alle PS4-consoles. Wordt geleverd met originele hoes (indien van toepassing).</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"809\">✅ Online third-person shooter met RPG-elementen<br data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"718\">✅ Uitdagende coöp en endgame content<br data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\">✅ Disc in goede staat<br data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"781\">✅ 1 week garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"845\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"845\">Vandaag besteld = snel spelen!</strong></p>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"912\">📋 <strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"912\">Specificaties – Tom Clancy’s The Division 2 – PS4</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"948\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"932\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"987\">🔫 <strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"964\">Genre:</strong> Online shooter / RPG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1034\">👥 <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1009\">Multiplayer:</strong> Ja – online coöp & PvP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1092\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1055\">Instelling:</strong> Post-apocalyptisch Washington D.C.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1156\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1113\">Verpakking:</strong> Inclusief hoesje (indien van toepassing)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1208\">💽 <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1171\">Disc:</strong> In goede staat – getest en werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1274\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1224\">Staat:</strong> In goede staat – lichte gebruikssporen mogelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1310\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1294\">Garantie:</strong> 1 week garantie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
